#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of OpenRC"
msgstr "Instalação do OpenRC"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Apply a patch to make the group which manages <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run/lock</filename> configurable:"
msgstr ""
"Apique um remendo para tornar o grupo que gerencia <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run/lock</filename> configurável:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:47
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&openrc-lock-patch;</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&openrc-lock-patch;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:49
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix a script to allow a normal installation:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um conjunto de comandos sequenciados para permitir uma instalação "
"normal:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:51
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/set -u/d' tools/meson_final.sh</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/set -u/d' tools/meson_final.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:53
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare OpenRC for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare OpenRC para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:55
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">mkdir build\n"
"cd    build\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D uucp_group=root  \\\n"
"            -D pam=false ..</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">mkdir build\n"
"cd    build\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D uucp_group=root  \\\n"
"            -D pam=false ..</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:64
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:67
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D uucp_group=root</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D uucp_group=root</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This changes who owns and manages <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run/lock</filename>, as OpenRC will try to use the "
"<systemitem class=\"groupname\">uucp</systemitem> group to manage it.  Many "
"distributions today use the <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">lock</systemitem> group, but LFS uses <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem> instead."
msgstr ""
"Isso muda quem titulariza e gerencia <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run/lock</filename>, vez que OpenRC tentará usar o "
"grupo <systemitem class=\"groupname\">uucp</systemitem> para gerenciá-lo. "
"Muitas distribuições hoje usam o grupo <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">lock</systemitem>, porém LFS usa <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D pam=false</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D pam=false</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This disables needing Linux-PAM for the build, since it is not installed "
"yet."
msgstr ""
"Isso desabilita a necessidade do Linux-PAM para a construção, pois ele ainda"
" não está instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:90
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">ninja</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue:"
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:94
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"test\">ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"test\">ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">if [ -d /etc/conf.d ]; then\n"
"  mv -v  /etc/conf.d{,.tmp}\n"
"  ninja install\n"
"  cp -vR /etc/conf.d.tmp/* /etc/conf.d\n"
"  rm -rf /etc/conf.d.tmp\n"
"else\n"
"  ninja install\n"
"fi\n"
"mv -v /usr/{s,}bin/rc-update</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">if [ -d /etc/conf.d ]; then\n"
"  mv -v  /etc/conf.d{,.tmp}\n"
"  ninja install\n"
"  cp -vR /etc/conf.d.tmp/* /etc/conf.d\n"
"  rm -rf /etc/conf.d.tmp\n"
"else\n"
"  ninja install\n"
"fi\n"
"mv -v /usr/{s,}bin/rc-update</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"OpenRC by default reinstalls the configuration files for the base services, "
"meaning that if you have configured a service like "
"<literal>agetty</literal>, a normal installation would have reset the "
"configuration to the default. The above ensures that doesn't happen when "
"applicable. The <command>rc-update</command> under some circumstances is "
"meant to be ran as a normal user as well, so it should be in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename>."
msgstr ""
"OpenRC, por padrão, reinstala os arquivos de configuração para os serviços "
"básicos, significando que, se você tiver configurado um serviço como "
"<literal>agetty</literal>, uma instalação normal teria reconfigurado a "
"configuração para o padrão. O acima garante que não aconteça quando "
"aplicável. O <command>rc-update</command> em algumas circunstâncias também "
"deve ser executado como um(a) usante normal, de modo que ele deveria estar "
"em <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/bin</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"OpenRC provides <application>init</application> and other programs of its "
"own. However, the shorthands for them aren't created. Create the symlinks:"
msgstr ""
"OpenRC fornece <application>init</application> e outros programas próprios. "
"No entanto, os atalhos para eles não são criados. Crie os linques "
"simbólicos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openrc.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for i in {init,shutdown}; do\n"
"  ln -svf openrc-$i /sbin/$i\n"
"done\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /sbin/poweroff &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/sbin/shutdown --poweroff now</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /sbin/reboot &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/sbin/shutdown --reboot now</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"chmod 755 /sbin/poweroff /sbin/reboot</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for i in {init,shutdown}; do\n"
"  ln -svf openrc-$i /sbin/$i\n"
"done\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /sbin/poweroff &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/sbin/shutdown --poweroff now</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /sbin/reboot &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/sbin/shutdown --reboot now</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"chmod 755 /sbin/poweroff /sbin/reboot</userinput>"

